    "created_at": "2018-01-06T11:49:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-06T11:49:28Z",
    "body": "Is it problematic if we apply this to all types of `input` elements or should we list the ones this should work for? E.g., it does not make much sense for `<input type=date>`, but it wouldn't be observable either, so probably fine?\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/i18n ",
