    "updated_at": "2018-01-06T18:30:38Z",
    "body": "> Note that we don't allow dirname for Telephone, URL, and E-mail. I guess that's fine?\r\n\r\nI think that's right. I guess technically they could be directional, but in practice they aren't. IIRC, Adlam is the only numbering system where the digits are RTL and I don't think that'll be used much for phone numbers?",
